00e4ume kannst einstellen...\n- wie das Publikum sich zusammensetzt\n- wie lange der Vortrag maximal sein darf (mit Stoppuhr)\n- wie Aufmerksam das Publikum zuh\u00f6rt\n\nIm Nachgang kannst Du dir nochmal anschauen und anh\u00f6ren, wie gut Du dich geschlagen hast.\n\nDie aktuellen R\u00e4ume sind:\n- Konferenzraum mit 3 Personen (Bewerbungsgespr\u00e4ch)\n- Seminarraum"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "ImpLandscape.png", "id": "2476178992540280", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/65398055_2476178995873613_5890563130306836643_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=d4Ssk3EBkJEQ7kNvwE-eYQe&_nc_oc=AdqWLzN1zPyYKDxilLwul17FhPJn-piwCKNBt7uEADsbwQMdFtVgEYkI65u1Qv9Dw4M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHLPushiuPxD4sU-VW3JqMD8_BOplYR6aTEx8ioHjvvHA&oe=6A8D8A47"}, {"file_name": "ImpCover.png", "id": "2401543720011882", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57575350_2401543723345215_1378399666035813534_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0X-Lheb5-W4Q7kNvwGd-puq&_nc_oc=AdqGSgY8oJ-RyfF-0uvB-MOSrrEAWi_wNeTSox_XklaGXGd3WNgUuuMS43aS7YuQj0k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEcpa8ddGIePXyYVQ_MYyUBk1nJIRR-DK5MmXepppnxpQ&oe=6A8D97FC"}, {"file_name": "ImpHero.png", "id": "1575384222929044", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974551_1575384226262377_3077729185527084450_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3yfQI9LN_wUQ7kNvwFF2Qm4&_nc_oc=AdqBAbAgWkC9aoH1w0ri3B9Pdp3RnjCvD0KdXQqrDk0izrHzK8ulqPgBQ0j-7e2HWdU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGLClYfNl_htZAn7APLuJDUP3GOcR5jQGddiWSYCnqPHQ&oe=6A8D892B"}, {"file_name": "Basic ohne Claim (3).png", "id": "1408933533196382", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38